@startuml
title Dashboard summary - successful request
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox

actor Client
boundary "Summary controller" as API
control GetDashboardSummaryHandler as Handler
database TimescaleDB as DB

Client -> API : GET /api/v1/dashboard/summary\nstart_time, end_time + Bearer token
ref over API,DB : Existing JWT and user/admin role checks
API -> API : Validate timezone-aware bounds\nstart_time < end_time
note over API,Handler : Controller creates handler with request-scoped AsyncSession
API -> Handler : handle(GetDashboardSummaryQuery)
Handler -> DB : One SELECT: independent COUNT(*) subqueries\nflows.ts_start, detections.created_at, alerts.created_at\n[start_time, end_time)
DB --> Handler : flow_count, detection_count, alert_count
Handler --> API : DashboardSummaryResponse
API --> Client : 200 + JSON counts
@enduml
